      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "• Explain failures from model → training → distributed system → GPU/node/data\n• Scale metrics without cardinality explosion\n• Make every artifact traceable by run_id\n• Turn evaluation into a promotion gate, not a dashboard",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Explain failures from model → training → distributed system → GPU/node/data\n• Scale metrics without cardinality explosion\n• Make every artifact traceable by run_id\n• Turn evaluation into a promotion gate, not a dashboard",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
