      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Per rank\n• rank_step_time • fwd/bwd/comm/data time\n• p50/p95/p99 + slowest rank\n\nCollectives\n• all-reduce latency\n• all-gather latency\n• reduce-scatter latency\n\nDerived\ncommunication_ratio = comm / step\nstraggler_ratio = max(rank) / median(rank)",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Per rank\n• rank_step_time • fwd/bwd/comm/data time\n• p50/p95/p99 + slowest rank\n\nCollectives\n• all-reduce latency\n• all-gather latency\n• reduce-scatter latency\n\nDerived\ncommunication_ratio = comm / step\nstraggler_ratio = max(rank) / median(rank)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
