    {
      "id": "e1123",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3318,
      "y": 2793,
      "width": 1504,
      "height": 138.24,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1123",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1672087624,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 70097968,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786743368049,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "• Prometheus vs event analytics: time-series speed vs high-cardinality joins\n• Per-GPU fidelity vs storage cost: tier retention and aggregate\n• Push vs scrape: training SDK emits events; infra agents scraped/forwarded\n• Exactly-once not required: use idempotent run/event IDs\n• Clock skew: normalize event time + ingest time + step number\n• Alert symptoms + context; do not page on every noisy low-level metric.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Prometheus vs event analytics: time-series speed vs high-cardinality joins\n• Per-GPU fidelity vs storage cost: tier retention and aggregate\n• Push vs scrape: training SDK emits events; infra agents scraped/forwarded\n• Exactly-once not required: use idempotent run/event IDs\n• Clock skew: normalize event time + ingest time + step number\n• Alert symptoms + context; do not page on every noisy low-level metric.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "e1124",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 110,
      "y": 3110,
      "width": 4680,
      "height": 28.16,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1124",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1138925840,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1412267728,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786743368049,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "INTERVIEW CLOSE:  “The platform is not a collection of GPU dashboards. It is a correlated run graph that lets researchers move from model-quality regression to the exact step, rank, node, GPU, data shard or configuration change — and then uses reproducible evaluation gates to decide whether the model can be promoted.”",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "INTERVIEW CLOSE:  “The platform is not a collection of GPU dashboards. It is a correlated run graph that lets researchers move from model-quality regression to the exact step, rank, node, GPU, data shard or configuration change — and then uses reproducible evaluation gates to decide whether the model can be promoted.”",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
