      "updated": 1786746992529,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Quota dashboard overview (total, usage, remaining, WoW usage, top consumers)\n- Usage explorer (by user, by team, by resourceType, by project)\n- Manage quota: create/edit/delet quota for user, teams, tenants\n- Receive Alerts: notify user, admin when usage crosses thresholds",
